# SysWizard — Environment Variables

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Tutor (Rishi)
# Rishi uses an OpenAI-compatible chat completions API.
# Set these two environment variables on your hosting platform:
AI_BASE_URL="https://your-api-endpoint/v1"
AI_API_KEY="your-api-key"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database (Prisma / SQLite) — OPTIONAL
# The core app uses localStorage for auth/progress.
# Prisma is included for future server-side features.
# Local dev: file:./db/custom.db
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Next.js
NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
